    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alone in the Stars: Survivor is an action rogue-lite where you destroy hordes of aliens and bosses using custom load-outs and synergies between power-ups.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In this third-person shooter, harness the power of deep customization\u2014choose your stats, abilities, weapons, and upgrade paths to create unstoppable synergies. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/d61921de34f5a692172be289088088ae.poster.avif?t=1742518002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/d61921de34f5a692172be289088088ae.webm?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/d61921de34f5a692172be289088088ae.mp4?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND OVERPOWERED SYNERGIES BETWEEN POWERUPS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All power-ups stack and scale infinitely. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergize different power-ups together with different elemental effects, explosions, on hit, on shoot, and many more unique effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique utility abilities and 4 damage abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match different pools of power-ups to find your preferred builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/0a1c92ac85e4fa60d334ab7805a250b4.poster.avif?t=1742518002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/0a1c92ac85e4fa60d334ab7805a250b4.webm?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/0a1c92ac85e4fa60d334ab7805a250b4.mp4?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mix together and build your own character to match your play style with:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 guns &amp; 1 sword to pick from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely change your base stats and equip unique passive abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique utility abilities and 4 damage abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the pool of power-ups available to you in a run.\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the look of your alien before each run. Change body types, colors, and more. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PROGRESS EVERY RUN</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new power-ups, passives, abilities, weapons, levels, and cosmetics. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/ce8acebada3545ec5ad3e8e520f7446b.poster.avif?t=1742518002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/ce8acebada3545ec5ad3e8e520f7446b.webm?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/ce8acebada3545ec5ad3e8e520f7446b.mp4?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DIFFERENT EVERY RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It'll feel different every time you play with:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 planets, unique enemies for every planet, and different layouts of each planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 elite emotional variants of every enemy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ power-ups to find different synergies with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random weapons in each run.   </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Alone in the Stars: Survivor is an action rogue-lite where you destroy hordes of aliens and bosses using custom load-outs and synergies between power-ups.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In this third-person shooter, harness the power of deep customization\u2014choose your stats, abilities, weapons, and upgrade paths to create unstoppable synergies. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/d61921de34f5a692172be289088088ae.poster.avif?t=1742518002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/d61921de34f5a692172be289088088ae.webm?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/d61921de34f5a692172be289088088ae.mp4?t=1742518002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND OVERPOWERED SYNERGIES BETWEEN POWERUPS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All power-ups stack and scale infinitely. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergize different power-ups together with different elemental effects, explosions, on hit, on shoot, and many more unique effects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 unique utility abilities and 4 damage abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match different pools of power-ups to find your preferred builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/0a1c92ac85e4fa60d334ab7805a250b4.poster.avif?t=1742518002\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478310/extras/0a1c92ac85e4fa60d334ab7805a250b4.webm?t=1742518002\" ty