ayouts of each planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 elite emotional variants of every enemy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ power-ups to find different synergies with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random weapons in each run.   </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fight through alien worlds, obliterating relentless foes, and forge your own path to unlimited power. In this third-person roguelite shooter, harness the power of deep customization. Adapt, experiment, and break the limits of power as you carve your legend across the stars.",
